Lis lè: ['kopye'] fè: {
	>> kopye := Lis nouvo.
	tèt-li chak: { :nimewo :section
		kopye ajoute-nan-fen: section rekisif kopye.
	}. <- kopye.
}.

>> sheep := Lis nouvo ; ['Dolly'] ; ['Shaun']. 
>> clones := sheep kopye.
clones chak: { :nimewo :sheep
	sheep ajoute-nan-fen: ['2'].
}.

Sòti ekri: sheep, nouvo-liy.
Sòti ekri: clones, nouvo-liy.
